{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "485dcc7f72da84ec23e16d8de08206d773e96b046c3a9e943300323eb34c8e9b", "ja": "{$P$}さん～。\nアイドルって、なんだか不思議ですね～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生～\n偶像真让人觉得不可思议呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8d09981e32e8853f5ad662c13ddae0dc57fc7374d21b0a630f21b508909d1dab", "ja": "どうしたんだ美也、やぶから棒に……。", "zh": "怎么啦，美也？为什么突然这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "d364bf3fec0d4e2a1e6580d172288dddcca6de0a2d251b3250d4dcd8a69d2d86", "ja": "はい～。この前、ステージに立った時のことを、\n思い出してたんです～。", "zh": "是～因为我回想起了\n之前站上舞台时的情景～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "d779736772720f55ba60be02a990b0c7b1e690d976416ca0be136b57ff483e59", "ja": "私、この衣装を着られるのが、\nとってもうれしくて、楽しみだったんですよ～。", "zh": "当时我真的很开心，\n也很期待穿上这套服装的那一刻喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c099289da2a81568c7c8663a287c5a5ae878839341379eb1872eebae69d89eb4", "ja": "嬉しくて楽しみだったなら、いいことじゃないか。\nそれとも、何か他に気になることがあるのか？", "zh": "既然开心又期待，那不是很好吗？\n还是说你有其他在意的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "7f4ae3e52782f98342fb50a3ed18591921bddecfcbc5a40208114446f9f5a5c8", "ja": "そうなんです～。私、ライブの後、\n{$P$}さんにお礼を言いたくて……。", "zh": "是啊～我在演唱会结束后原本想向\n{$P$}先生道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "99708200c44a5bdfbdca0411fc8407b84ae033384d5968361e00df845ae0a47b", "ja": "でも、いざ{$P$}さんを前にしたら、\n言葉が出てこなくなってしまったんです～。", "zh": "但一站到{$P$}先生面前，\n就说不出话来了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3a45f8c7743661394e28104503a6ddb7e0fcbf041eae748c5181aa30ca3e7f84", "ja": "そうだったのか？", "zh": "是这样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "a1e35d7982e8609ad3c4c7e717f23e9877f3895bfa6f5bb1691683f9400deeb1", "ja": "はい～。だから、またこの衣装を着たら、今度こそ\nちゃんとお礼を言おうと思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "对～所以我就想，下次要是能再穿上这套服装，\n一定要好好道谢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "8e816970ed72e0fd023002bb73bc710c59b51a9dd658e04bd0c0bd740bd9e78d", "ja": "ヘンですね～。やっぱり、言葉が出てきませんよ～。", "zh": "但是好奇怪～我还是说不出话来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4b0651c295590dec95c53ccfd97a4684ba2c87cc4249f1c3aa592a1f96f0e7d3", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、美也。\n美也の気持ちは、今の言葉で十分伝わったよ。", "zh": "没关系的，美也。\n听了刚才那些话，我已经明白美也的心意了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "0a7544b958b786b432e05cedb7546fdf6b4644f748513d7e51b4fde331672dc1", "ja": "む～ん、それも不思議ですね～？\nアイドルになると、不思議なことばかり起こります～。", "zh": "唔～嗯，这也很不可思议呢～\n当上偶像以后，就一直发生不可思议的事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d65ca21349cf23e50d477b87a95bbcfb87ceea9b3e656475c6bf9770ebdb606b", "ja": "そうだな、不思議で楽しいだろ？　これからも、\n一緒にトップアイドル目指して頑張ろうな！", "zh": "是啊，既不可思议又很有趣吧？\n今后我们也一起以顶尖偶像为目标，好好加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0034_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0034_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "844ae766682b4dc73305515bbea81c925d4e01ea7a4f4cc12306a368aa798bf9", "ja": "そうですね～。私と{$P$}さん、\nふたりで一緒に、歴史の教科書に載りましょうね～。", "zh": "是啊～让我和{$P$}先生\n两人一起被写进历史课本里吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
